1
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,000
Here you are.

2
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:35,520
Come down for a swim.

3
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,320
Sorry, Ms. Song Huan.

4
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:39,320
I can't swim.

5
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:41,520
Don't you live by the sea?

6
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,000
How can you not swim?

7
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,240
Living by the sea

8
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:47,000
doesn't mean I have to swim.

9
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:48,240
I'm afraid of water.

10
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:12,760
Song Lin's out.

11
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:14,160
Next one

12
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:15,800
is Song Cheng.

13
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:18,240
Ms. Song Cheng?

14
00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:22,400
She's not a threat to you right now.

15
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:23,520
She's not.

16
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,200
But you are.

17
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,480
You're the real threat.

18
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:34,000
You want me to prove my loyalty to you.

19
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,080
Once I betray you,

20
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,360
I'll have no way out.

21
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,720
I like your brains.

22
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:41,920
And your loyalty.

23
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,320
But you can only be loyal to one person.

24
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:50,760
What do you want me to do?

25
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:54,840
Song Cheng wants to please Yu Qixian.

26
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,920
She's probably carving a wooden horse.

27
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,560
Destroy it.

28
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:03,320
I've hired the best woodcarver
from overseas

29
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,240
to create a perfect piece.

30
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,840
Once she embarrasses herself,

31
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,240
the horse ranch project

32
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,840
will be mine alone.

33
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,320
Sorry, Ms. Song Huan.

34
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,120
Ms. Song Cheng has been good to me.

35
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,520
I can't do that to her.

36
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,400
Help!

37
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:22,480
Here's another lesson.

38
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,120
If it's a weakness,

39
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,120
don't tell anyone about it.

40
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,560
I'll give you three days.

41
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,360
Think it over.

42
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:32,320
Be the knife in my hand,

43
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:35,280
or the fish on the chopping block.

44
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:38,260
=Dear Song=

45
00:03:38,380 --> 00:03:41,180
=Episode 13=
(A Narrow Escape)

46
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,960
How dare you come back?

47
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:57,720
Why wouldn't I?

48
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:58,560
The boss gave the order.

49
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:00,240
(Security)
I'd let a dog in, not you.

50
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:01,520
Which boss?

51
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:03,400
Song Huaishan or Song Huan?

52
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,720
That's none of your business.

53
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:05,440
Get lost!

54
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,280
(Security)
What?

55
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,200
Get lost!

56
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,640
Just you wait.

57
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,840
(Tomorrow's the third day.)

58
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:26,360
(I have to give Song Huan an answer.)

59
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,400
Dad is really...

60
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,520
Taking care of me
is hard enough already.

61
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:36,400
Now he even has you filling in
as housekeeper.

62
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,720
You must be exhausted.

63
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:41,400
Mr. Song trusts me.

64
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:43,920
That's why he gave me the job.

65
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:47,560
It's getting late.

66
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,160
Ready for bed?

67
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,960
I want to carve a little longer.

68
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:52,680
Okay.

69
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,520
I'll stay with you.

70
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,120
You've been following me all this time,

71
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,040
come on in.

72
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,200
Yu Song.

73
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:04,200
You used a fake identity
to get into the Song family.

74
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:07,080
You came here to avenge your father,
Yu Pingjiang, didn't you?

75
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:10,200
I'm calling Song Huaishan now.

76
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:11,840
You'll be thrown out.

77
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:13,400
And your dad's name

78
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:14,800
will be dragged through the mud.

79
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:16,000
Where's your proof?

80
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,520
Just empty words.

81
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,000
Who'd believe you?

82
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:21,720
I'm the proof.

83
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:24,000
You think all that shady stuff with Jing

84
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,280
went unnoticed?

85
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,320
You have two choices.

86
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,320
Either...

87
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,000
You steal the real proposal

88
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,400
for the hot spring project,

89
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,280
or...

90
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:34,720
we go down together.

91
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:40,040
Go down together?

92
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:42,000
Zhao Hui.

93
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,200
You think you're worth taking me down?

94
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:50,600
A man who got ahead by living off women.

95
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:53,000
Song Lin has wanted to dump you
for ages, right?

96
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:55,480
When she can't stand you in her bed,

97
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:57,480
does she even look at you?

98
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:01,320
Everyone knows you're her lapdog.

99
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:05,040
So you think having dirt on me

100
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,800
will turn your life around?

101
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,880
In Song Huaishan's eyes,

102
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,920
you're worse than a dog.

103
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:16,200
Those nightclub days of yours,

104
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:18,320
Song Lin must've known for ages.

105
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:19,680
Why didn't she expose you?

106
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:21,600
Because she found it too humiliating.

107
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,400
Zhao Hui.

108
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:27,200
If you dare lay a hand on me,

109
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,920
I'll let everyone in Nigang City know

110
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:33,560
the man who married into the Song family

111
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:35,600
is nothing but trash.

112
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,920
You're asking for it!

113
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,240
Do you know how hard it was

114
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,360
for me to get this far?

115
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,280
I've given so much to the Song family.

116
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:48,600
Song Huaishan never took me seriously.

117
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:51,120
And now you've ruined it all!

118
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,720
You've got no one else to blame.

119
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:55,640
Your greed ruined you!

120
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,360
Fine, then.

121
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,960
We'll die together!

122
00:08:08,640 --> 00:08:09,720
Stop!

123
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,040
Ms. Song Cheng!

124
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,200
Zhao Hui's gone crazy.

125
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:14,840
He made me steal the proposal.

126
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:15,480
Song Cheng.

127
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,760
Don't listen to her lies.

128
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:18,640
She's no housekeeper.

129
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,240
She came here with an ulterior motive.

130
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:21,720
Nothing she says is true.

131
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,040
Everything about her is fake.

132
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:24,240
Her credentials are fake.

133
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:26,120
So is her job as housekeeper here.

134
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:27,400
All she really wants

135
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:29,080
is the Song family's fortune!

136
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:35,520
I don't believe you.

137
00:08:35,800 --> 00:08:38,240
I only saw you break into her room.

138
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,640
And you tried to hurt Yu Song!

139
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,280
Song Cheng.

140
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:46,760
Your legs don't work.

141
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:48,320
Does your brain not work either?

142
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,200
Fine.

143
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:50,840
Then so be it.

144
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:53,120
We'll die together!

145
00:09:07,640 --> 00:09:08,400
This one

146
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:09,880
is for Ms. Song Cheng.

147
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,160
Get up.

148
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:15,400
This one

149
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:16,400
is for Yu Song.

150
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:20,760
And this one

151
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,760
is for myself.

152
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,680
See?

153
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:34,920
I wasn't lying.

154
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,560
She's in league with Jing!

155
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,120
Mr. Zhao.

156
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:49,080
You broke into her home.

157
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:51,160
The evidence that you tried to kill her
with a knife is all here.

158
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:52,920
No one will believe you.

159
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:55,040
I called the police on the way.

160
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,840
Attempted murder,

161
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,360
plus your other crimes...

162
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,240
You're finished.

163
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,840
Why did you

164
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:18,160
come here today?

165
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:20,920
Actually...

166
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,960
After you left,

167
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:25,240
I had a bad feeling.

168
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:30,440
So I followed you all the way,

169
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:33,480
until Zhao Hui showed up.

170
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:35,840
That's when I called the police.

171
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:40,640
And then...

172
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,600
You know the rest.

173
00:10:44,260 --> 00:10:48,580
♪All my thoughts freeze in place♪

174
00:10:49,020 --> 00:10:52,520
♪My aching nerves start to twitch♪

175
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:53,440
Ms. Song Cheng.

176
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:56,360
Today was far too dangerous.

177
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,720
Please don't do that again.

178
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:01,040
♪Who leaves whom behind in the past♪

179
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:01,920
Actually...

180
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:03,880
Every day...

181
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:06,040
Morning and night,

182
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:08,440
I'd stand by the window

183
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:10,960
watching you come and go.

184
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,320
♪The one who leaves
isn't the one to pity♪

185
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,400
I always thought

186
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:15,840
you looked so lonely.

187
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:19,020
♪The one left behind
sews their tears inside♪

188
00:11:19,340 --> 00:11:23,780
♪Love and hate share a seam♪

189
00:11:24,180 --> 00:11:26,260
♪Half longing♪

190
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:28,700
♪Half resentment♪

191
00:11:29,060 --> 00:11:33,740
♪Love spreads through the eyes♪

192
00:11:33,860 --> 00:11:36,300
♪It shapes infinity♪

193
00:11:36,420 --> 00:11:39,100
♪A circle turning endlessly♪

194
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,480
Sorry, Yu Song.

195
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:42,640
I'm not some creep.

196
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:43,960
I just...

197
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,320
I just wanted

198
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:48,280
to keep you company in my own way.

199
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:51,640
♪If love always hides something♪

200
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:52,560
Ms. Song Cheng.

201
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:55,480
Zhao Hui was right.

202
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,480
♪Then her tears♪

203
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,040
I'm a liar.

204
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,040
♪Fade away♪

205
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,640
My resume is fake.

206
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,560
Jing and I already knew each other.

207
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:07,320
I joined the Song family

208
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:09,120
with an ulterior motive.

209
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:13,960
If you need me to leave,

210
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:17,080
I'll go right now.

211
00:12:21,860 --> 00:12:26,340
♪She said it was wrong from the start♪

212
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:28,520
Don't.

213
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:31,360
I don't care if your resume is real.

214
00:12:31,760 --> 00:12:33,280
I only care about you.

215
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:35,680
I don't know your plans,

216
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:37,520
but I trust you.

217
00:12:38,280 --> 00:12:39,560
You won't hurt me.

218
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,240
Right?

219
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:43,240
(Mom and Dad are gone.)

220
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:46,400
(I'll be all alone now.)

221
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:48,040
(Stay away, you Stinky Fish Beggar.)

222
00:12:48,040 --> 00:12:49,720
(No one wants to play with you.)

223
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:52,520
(Song, we have no family left.)

224
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:53,720
(Just us now.)

225
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:55,040
♪If love always hides something♪

226
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:55,840
Yu Song.

227
00:12:56,640 --> 00:12:57,560
Please...

228
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:59,760
Don't leave me.

229
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:01,520
I promise you,

230
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:03,680
I won't tell anyone anything.

231
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,920
Please?

232
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:13,240
Okay.

233
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:15,960
I promise.

234
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:19,640
Unless you insist I leave,

235
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:23,280
I won't leave you.

236
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:26,640
Mm.

237
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:57,740
♪Our eyes met amid the chaos♪

238
00:13:58,260 --> 00:14:03,020
♪All my thoughts freeze in place♪

239
00:14:03,220 --> 00:14:08,020
♪My aching nerves start to twitch♪

240
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:12,700
♪Will love break when it ends♪

241
00:14:12,940 --> 00:14:17,780
♪Who leaves whom behind in the past♪

242
00:14:18,140 --> 00:14:22,940
♪Who will play the heartless one♪

243
00:14:23,060 --> 00:14:27,860
♪The one who leaves
isn't the one to pity♪

244
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:32,900
♪The one left behind
sews their tears inside♪
